Hi David,

Could we use our 30 minutes at 1:30 on Thursday, April 18, to look at the fiv=
e proposed aims in the attached Word document?

At the desk check Erin found the usual deadline quickly but applied it to the=
 exception case too. I'd like your view on removing the number of words found=
 within a set time from the achievement condition. We could still time the ac=
tivity to manage the lesson, while asking learners to show how they use the c=
onditions in the text.

I'm also unsure whether the fourth aim should ask people to choose the more r=
estrictive instruction or compare who issued each instruction and what it cov=
ers. I've marked that question in the document.

Thanks,
Heather

